the greens versus the blacks HBO's House  of the Dragon has the Targaryen family  hurtling toward a Civil War for the Iron  Throne that will split the realm in two  this Targaryen infighting nicknamed the  dance of the Dragons has revealed two  main factions with Queen Alison  Hightower leading the greens and  Princess rhaenyra Targaryen leading the  blacks but just who are the greens and  the blacks and which dragons are on each  side  [Music]  yo will go over why they're called the  greens and the blacks who supports each  faction who's still undecided and how  many dragons each side has also I'll try  to avoid any spoilers for the entire  video for those of you who haven't read  the book Fire and Blood and are just  enjoying House of the dragon as it comes  out so to understand exactly who the  greens and the blacks are we need to  First understand what started the dance  of the Dragons as we saw in House of the  Dragon King viserys Targaryen the first  and his first wife Emma were unable to  have a male child to succeed him as King  which is customary in Westeros upon  Emma's death while in childbirth King  viserys named his eldest daughter  Ramirez as his heir to the Iron Throne  an unprecedented action which sent  shockwaves throughout the Seven Kingdoms  just a few decades before rhaeny's  Targaryen was passed over for viserys  Targaryen to sit on the Iron Throne when  the Lords of Westeros voted in his favor  in the great council at harrenhal simply  because he was a man so to solidify  Rainier's claim viserys had all the high  Lords of Westeros come to King's Landing  to pledge themselves to her as viserys's  Heir years later though viserys  remarried to Lady Allison Hightower and  had three three sons and one daughter  upon the birth of their firstborn son  aegon II many lords of the Seven  Kingdoms expected viserys to change his  mind to name aegon as his Heir instead  he held fast to Rainier his claim to the  throne which is what initially started  the internal strife between the  targaryens essentially the root of the  Civil War lies in the fact that King  viserys named his eldest child rhaenyra  as heir to the Iron Throne rather than  his eldest male child aegon so why  exactly are they called the greens and  the blacks the nicknames for each side  come from somewhat contradictory  accounts of events preceding the dance  of the dragons in the TV series House of  the Dragon Queen Allison wears a green  dress the color of her house Hightower  to the wedding Feast for rhaenira and  laner valerion when she would be  expected to wear the colors of the  family she married into black and red in  the book Fire and Blood however the  names come from a very different event a  king viserys and queen Allison's fifth  wedding anniversary Rainier wore an  extravagant red and black gown while  Alison wore a vibrant green one  thereafter it became the custom to refer  to Greens and blacks when talking about  the Queen's party and the princess's  party quick plug if you like like what  you're seeing hit that subscribe button  for more videos like this now back to  the video now that we know how each  faction got their name let's talk about  who supports each side in the greens  Corner we have Queen Allison Hightower  pushing for her son Egon II descent on  the Iron Throne along with the Hightower  family Laris strong and Sir Kristen Cole  in the blacks Corner we have princess  Rainier Targaryen and her sons along  with the king's brother Damon and the  valerion family Undeclared as of yet are  several members of King viserys's small  Council including Grand maester Melos  master of ships or Thailand Lannister  and master of coin Lord Lyman beesberry  these men and all the great and lesser  houses of the Seven Kingdoms will soon  have to make their choice some will be  swayed by promise of future advantage or  Royal marriage others by their loyalty  Duty and honor and some will try to  remain neutral to avoid the cost to  anyone involved in this war which side  has more dragons though the greens  currently have three dragons including  the largest living Dragon Veigar written  by aemond Sunfire written by aegon and  dream fire written by Helena while the  blacks have five tame dragons including  Cyrax written by rhaenyra Vermax written  by Jace karaxis written by Damon Moon  Dancer written by Bala melis written by  rhaenys and potentially more wild  dragons as they reside in Dragonstone  while the blacks have more dragons on  their side the greens are able to level  the playing field because Eamon bonded  with the dragon vegar after the death of  Lena valerion giving the greens one of  the largest and oldest dragons of all  time so for the time being the dragon  power is pretty equal between the two  factions now without spoiling anything  an important question arises which side  has the better claim to the throne  rhaenyra or aegon II under the typical  laws of succession established over the  past Century through house targaryen's  reign in Westeros aegon II would have  been Crown King over Amira in an instant  however I'd argue that rhaenyra has the  better claim simply because viserys  directly named her as his Heir and all  the great houses of the Seven Kingdoms  swore their loyalty to her the only  thing which gives aegon's claim a bit of  legitimacy is the tired tradition of men  only wanting to support male rulers  while it's understandable that Allison  should fear for her children's lives  should Rainier I send the iron throne  and that her anger towards Rainier is  only exacerbated by the incident where  Rainier's son Luke cut out the eye of  Allison's son aemond I don't think it's  quite necessary to start a whole Civil  War because of it she could instead make  peace with Rainier and support her claim  as Queen to avoid thousands of  unnecessary deaths but I'll leave it up  to you which side are you supporting the  greens or the blacks drop your thoughts  in the comment section 